{"id":"n72482-1-12","stage":1,"title":"행사 · 活动","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72482-1-12-1","ko":"내 결혼식에 와 줄 거지?","zh":"你会来参加我的婚礼吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"결혼식에","meaning":"婚礼","explanation":"결혼식：婚礼；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31666","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼식에","audio":"/audio/dc0a00afc5c73cbecb80.mp3"}},{"text":"와","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"줄","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거지","audio":"/audio/a9e973ff709d931a2b92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"95cfb1a60ed967ea","term":"결혼식","zh":"婚礼","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3","entryId":"31666","definition":"宣告成人男女成为法定夫妻的仪式。","pronunciation":["결혼식"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/af072886ab651246adfc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72482-1-12-2","ko":"그럼. 네 인생에서 가장 큰 행사인데 당연히 가야지.","zh":"当然会。那可是你人生中最重要的一场庆典，我肯定要去啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼.","meaning":"可不是，就是，当然","explanation":"그럼：可不是，就是，当然。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"인생에서","meaning":"人生","explanation":"인생：人生；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"인생","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62449","senseId":"1","lemma":"인생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인생에서","audio":"/audio/605efa26e76a83c429c8.mp3"}},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最。","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"행사인데","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행사인데","audio":"/audio/4dd020f0a864f5bd09c2.mp3"}},{"text":"당연히","meaning":"当然","explanation":"당연히：当然。","readings":[{"term":"당연히","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49497","senseId":"1","lemma":"당연히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당연히","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3"}},{"text":"가야지.","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야지","audio":"/audio/10b48a12137f4b94d9e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"可不是，就是，当然","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"62277","definition":"用于肯定回答，表示自不必说，没有疑问。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f5266ca313518a9f","term":"인생","zh":"人生","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3","entryId":"62449","definition":"人在世上生活的事。","pronunciation":["인생"]},{"id":"8fd32c9572450